  <h1 class="article-title">WorkManager, JobScheduler &amp; AlarmManager</h1>
  <p class="article-subtitle">How Android schedules work that must survive process death &mdash; WorkManager&rsquo;s full lifecycle, constraints, chaining, expedited work, Hilt injection, testing, JobScheduler&rsquo;s trigger model, AlarmManager&rsquo;s exact timing, Doze mode survival, App Standby Buckets, and the decision tree for picking the right tool every time.</p>
  <div class="article-meta-strip">
    <div class="meta-item">&#x2699;&#xFE0F; <strong>WorkManager</strong></div>
    <div class="meta-item">&#x1F4CB; <strong>JobScheduler</strong></div>
